  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Raspberry Bush.png|200px|left|Raspberry bush]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Trees and Bushes|Trees & bushes]]\n |level = 19\n |price = 220\n |gives = {{Infoicon|rasp|big|link=Raspberry}}\n |time = every 18 h\n |xp = 9\n |dia = 14\n}}\n'''Raspberry bushes''' are a type of [[Trees and Bushes|bush]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 19.\n\nEach bush can give up to 13 [[Raspberry|raspberries]], which are collected over 4 harvests.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Stages'''===\n\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|{{NoPic}}\n|[[File:Raspberry Bush Stage 2.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Raspberry Bush.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Raspberry Bush Dead.png|100px]]\n|-\n|'''Stage 1'''\n|'''Stage 2'''\n|'''Ready'''\n|'''Dead'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Buying'''===\n{{Infoicon|shop|bigger|link=Shop}} Raspberry bushes can be purchased in the [[shop]] for 220 [[coin]]s each.\n----\n==='''Harvesting'''===\nThe time between harvests is 18 hours for each bush. Each harvest yields additional raspberries:\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Raspberry Bush Harvest 2.png|150px]]\n|[[File:Raspberry Bush Harvest 3.png|150px]]\n|[[File:Raspberry Bush.png|150px]]\n|-\n|'''2 raspberries'''\n|'''3 raspberries'''\n|'''4 raspberries'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Revival'''===\n[[File:Raspberry Bush Revival.png|left|150px]]\nAfter the third harvest the bush wilts. A player can ask for another player to revive it by tapping on it and placing a sign on the bush. When another player revives it a final harvest of four raspberries can be collected before the bush dies. The helper gets 9 {{Infoicon|xp}} points by reviving a raspberry bush.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Removing'''===\n[[File:Axe.png|150px|left]]\nAn [[Axe]] is needed to remove a dead bush from the farm. Note that players may also use an axe to remove the bush after the third harvest instead of placing it up for revival.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Himbeerstrauch\n|es = Frambueso\n|fr = Framboisier\n|it = Cespuglio Di Lamponi\n|no = Bringebærbusk\n|ru = Куст малины\n|zh = 树莓丛\n}}\n[[Category:Trees and Bushes]]",
  "wikitextHash": "ade6df73b35583a45ade79077512768d6b2390b67e5b508c0a34eb31f50357ef"
}
